{"unit_id":"Leeminjing__dsh-eyes#card-zh","repo":"Leeminjing/dsh-eyes","commit":"b645e41dd6afeba06c58414914a77a150d49fe1a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-eyes 是一个面向 DeepSeek Harness 的视觉插件，让纯文本模型能够按需查看会话图片。它包装模型信息解析与消息派发流程，保存图片附件引用，并注册 view_image 工具。主模型可查看单张或多张会话图片，也可读取本地图片；插件将图片发送到视觉接口，支持 Chat Completions 和 Responses API，并把识别结果返回给主模型。适合需要对截图、照片或图表提问的用户。需要配置 VISION_API_KEY、VISION_MODEL；默认使用 DashScope 兼容接口，也可指定其他 OpenAI 兼容视觉端点。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:280-340","lib/index.js:342-473","lib/index.js:191-229"]}
{"unit_id":"Leeminjing__dsh-eyes#card-en","repo":"Leeminjing/dsh-eyes","commit":"b645e41dd6afeba06c58414914a77a150d49fe1a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-eyes gives text-only DeepSeek Harness models on-demand image understanding. It registers view_image so a model can inspect session attachments or local files through a configurable OpenAI-compatible vision API. Configure its key and model to analyze screenshots, photos, and charts.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:280-340","lib/index.js:342-473","lib/index.js:191-229"]}
