{"unit_id":"Leeminjing__dsh-eyes#feature-1","repo":"Leeminjing/dsh-eyes","commit":"b645e41dd6afeba06c58414914a77a150d49fe1a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-eyes 的功能「会话图片按需查看」：发送含图消息后，插件把图片替换为附件引用说明，模型需要看图时调用 view_image，读取附件并返回视觉模型生成的描述或 OCR 文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:241-277","lib/index.js:342-388"]}
{"unit_id":"Leeminjing__dsh-eyes#feature-2","repo":"Leeminjing/dsh-eyes","commit":"b645e41dd6afeba06c58414914a77a150d49fe1a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-eyes 的功能「批量分析图片」：模型可在一次 view_image 调用中提供多个 attachment_id；插件并行请求视觉接口并按图片顺序返回分段结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:390-458"]}
{"unit_id":"Leeminjing__dsh-eyes#feature-3","repo":"Leeminjing/dsh-eyes","commit":"b645e41dd6afeba06c58414914a77a150d49fe1a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-eyes 的功能「读取本地图片」：模型调用 view_image 并传入 image_path 后，插件读取 PNG、JPEG、WebP、GIF 或 BMP 图片，再交给视觉模型分析并返回文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:425-458"]}
{"unit_id":"Leeminjing__dsh-eyes#feature-4","repo":"Leeminjing/dsh-eyes","commit":"b645e41dd6afeba06c58414914a77a150d49fe1a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-eyes 的功能「图片索引持久化」：插件按会话保存附件引用索引到 DSH_HOME 下的文件，并在启动时读回，使已登记图片在进程重启后仍可按附件 ID 查询。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:73-129"]}
{"unit_id":"Leeminjing__dsh-eyes#caveat-1","repo":"Leeminjing/dsh-eyes","commit":"b645e41dd6afeba06c58414914a77a150d49fe1a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-eyes 使用前须知：会话附件图片或本地图片会随请求发送到配置的视觉接口进行分析；默认端点为 DashScope，图片会编码进请求体。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:58","lib/index.js:191-203","lib/index.js:396-400"]}
{"unit_id":"Leeminjing__dsh-eyes#caveat-2","repo":"Leeminjing/dsh-eyes","commit":"b645e41dd6afeba06c58414914a77a150d49fe1a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-eyes 使用前须知：必须配置视觉接口密钥和模型名；图片索引在 DSH_HOME 下保存为 attachments/v1/dsh-eyes-index.json。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:53-70","lib/index.js:86-87","lib/index.js:123-124"]}
